ion flags (Altman Z 4.2, in the safe zone).","The Beneish M-score (-1.90) sits just under the manipulation line, so earnings quality bears watching."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 22.4% over 3 years, 19.6% over 5 years and 7.7% over 10 years, so growth is accelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 20%).","At current returns, reinvesting 7% of profits supports about 0.5% a year of fundamental growth, too little to drive meaningful growth.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 52%.","Capex runs only 0.5x depreciation (1.5% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 17, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own 10.7%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 89%.","Insider trading is two-way: 3 purchases and 4 sales over the past year, net $7.7M sold.","The share count has grown 10.8% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 1,540 employees, each generates about $503K of revenue, 1.4x the Industrials median, and productivity has risen 13.0% a year.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$4K per employee.","CEO pay is $2.3M (5x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $9K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"CECO","date":"2026-11-06"}